    LLM: 'Game: Briscola Chiamata. 5-player. 40-card Italian deck. Auction sets trump+partner card. Partner is SECRET. No follow-suit. Ranking: A(11)>3(10)>K(4)>Q(3)>J(2).',
    Player: 'You bid 62 and called the Ace of Swords as your partner card. You hold the Ace of Cups, Ace of Coins, and 3 of Coins. Your partner (who has the Ace of Swords) should protect your Acesâ€”watch who leads or plays in a way that helps you rather than fights you.',
